**Q10: What's the difference between COPY and ADD in Dockerfile?**

A:
```dockerfile
# COPY: Simple file copying from host to container
COPY app.py /app/

# ADD: Can copy + extract archives, download from URLs
ADD archive.tar.gz /app/
ADD https://example.com/file.zip /app/
```

Best practice: Use COPY unless you need ADD's features.

